REGENT OF KUBU RAYA

REGENT OF KUBU RAYA

WEST KALIMANTAN PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF KUBU RAYA REGENCY NUMBER 9 YEAR 2016

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN FROM ACTS OF VIOLENCE BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY THE REGENT OF KUBU RAYA,

Considering Whereas

a. that violence against women constitutes a violation of human rights so that women need to be protected in their dignity and honor and guaranteed their right to life in accordance with their nature and disposition;

b. that to overcome violence against women in Kubu Raya Regency, prevention efforts and optimization of overcoming violence against women through policies to ensure legal protection for women are needed;

c. that to provide legal protection for women, the regulation of protection of women from acts of violence needs to be regulated in a Regional Regulation;

d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Protection of Women From Acts of Violence;

1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia Year 1945;

2. Law Number 35 Year 2007 concerning the Establishment of Kubu Raya Regency in West Kalimantan Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2007 Number 101, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4751);

3. Law Number 23 Year 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587) as amended several times most recently by Law Number 9 Year 2015 concerning the Second Amendment to Law Number 23 Year 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Year 2015 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5679);

By Joint Approval

REGIONAL PEOPLE'S REPRESENTATIVE COUNCIL OF KUBU RAYA REGENCY and

REGENT OF KUBU RAYA

HAS DECIDED:

To Establish REGIONAL REGULATION CONCERNING THE PROTECTION OF WOMEN FROM ACTS OF VIOLENCE.

