Pasal 7

(1)

(2)

Bentuk pelayanan dan/ a tau penanganan terhadap korban meliputi: a. penanganan pengaduan termasuk identifikasi;

b. pelayanan rehabilitasi kesehatan/ medis;

c. pelayanan rehabilitasi sosial;

d. pelayanan penegakan dan bantuan hukum;

e. pelayanan pemulangan dan reintegrasi sosial; dan

f. pelayanan psikologis.

Bentuk pelayanan sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1) dilaksanakan sesuai dengan Standar Pelayanan Minimal yang ditetapkan perundang undangan yang dilaksanakan oleh perangkat daerah sesuai dengan tupoksinya.

translated_text:
Article 7

(1)

(2)

Forms of services and/or handling of victims include: a. handling complaints including identification;

b. health/medical rehabilitation services;

c. social rehabilitation services;

d. legal enforcement and legal aid services;

e. repatriation and social reintegration services; and

f. psychological services.

Forms of services as referred to in paragraph (1) shall be implemented in accordance with Minimum Service Standards established by laws and regulations implemented by regional apparatus in accordance with their duties and functions.

text:
Pasal 8

Pelayanan dan/ atau penanganan terhadap korban dilaksanakan dengan: a. cepat dan tepat;

b. aman dan nyaman;

c. rasa empati;

d. nondiskriminasi;

e. mudah dijangkau;

f. tidak dikenakan biaya; dan

g. dijamin kerahasiaannya.

translated_text:
Article 8

Services and/or handling of victims shall be implemented with: a. speed and accuracy;

b. safety and comfort;

c. sense of empathy;

d. non-discrimination;

e. easy accessibility;

f. no charges; and

g. guaranteed confidentiality.

text:
Pasal 9

Pemberdayaan sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 4 huruf c meliputi: a. membentuk komunitas perempuan korban kekerasan;

b. pelatihan kerja;

c. usaha ekonomi produktif dan kelompok usaha bersama; dan d. bantuan permodalan.

translated_text:
Article 9

Empowerment as referred to in Article 4 letter c includes: a. establishing communities of women victims of violence;

b. job training;

c. productive economic enterprises and joint business groups; and d. capital assistance.

text:
Pasal 13

Kekerasan terhadap perempuan terdiri atas:

a. kekerasan fisik;
b. kekerasan psikis;
c. kekerasan seksual;
d. penelantaran;
e. eksploitasi; dan/atau
f. kekerasan lainnya.

translated_text:
Article 13

Violence against women consists of:

a. physical violence;
b. psychological violence;
c. sexual violence;
d. neglect;
e. exploitation; and/or
f. other violence.

text:
Pasal 20

Setiap perempuan korban kekerasan berhak:

a. dihormati harkat dan martabatnya sebagai manusia;
b. mendapatkan pemulihan kesehatan fisik dan psikologis dari penderitaan yang dialami;
c. menentukan sendiri keputusannya;
d. mendapatkan informasi;
e. dirahasiakan identitasnya;
f. mendapatkan kompensasi;
g. mendapatkan rehabilitasi sosial;
h. mendapatkan bimbingan rohani;
1. mendapatkan penanganan pengaduan;
J. mendapatkan kemudahan dalam proses peradilan;
k. mendapatkan pendampingan; dan
I. jaminan atas hak yang berkaitan dengan status sebagai anggota keluarga maupun anggota masyarakat.

translated_text:
Article 20

Every woman victim of violence has the right to:

a. have her dignity and honor respected as a human being;
b. receive physical and psychological health recovery from the suffering experienced;
c. determine her own decisions;
d. receive information;
e. have her identity kept confidential;
f. receive compensation;
g. receive social rehabilitation;
h. receive spiritual guidance;
1. receive complaint handling;
J. receive facilitation in the judicial process;
k. receive assistance; and
I. guarantee of rights related to status as a family member and community member.

text:
Pasal 23

Masyarakat dan keluarga mempunyai kewajiban dan tanggung jawab: a. mencegah terjadinya kekerasan terhadap perempuan;

b. melaporkan bila terjadi kekerasan;

c. melindungi korban; dan

d. memberikan pertolongan darurat.

translated_text:
Article 23

Communities and families have obligations and responsibilities to: a. prevent the occurrence of violence against women;

b. report when violence occurs;

c. protect victims; and

d. provide emergency assistance.

text:
Pasal 28

(1) Masyarakat berperan serta dalam penyelenggaraan perlindungan perempuan.

(2) Peran serta masyarakat sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1) berupa: a. membentuk mitra keluarga ditingkat kelurahan/desa oleh masyarakat;

b. membentuk unit perlindungan perernpuan dalam orgarusasi kemasyarakatan;

c. melakukan sosialisasi hak perempuan secara mandiri;

d. melakukan upaya pencegahan jika menemukan indikasi kekerasan terhadap perernpuan dimasyarakat;

e. melakukan pertolongan pertama pada korban; dan

f. melaporkan kepada instansi yang berwenang apabila dilingkungannya terjadi kekerasan terhadap perempuan.

(3) Peran serta masyarakat sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1) dapat dilakukan oleh perorangan, lembaga sosial kemasyarakatan, lembaga swadaya masyarakat, lembaga pendidikan, lembaga keagamaan, swasta, dan/ atau media massa.

translated_text:
Article 28

(1) The community shall participate in the implementation of women's protection.

(2) Community participation as referred to in paragraph (1) shall be in the form of: a. establishing family partners at the sub-district/village level by the community;

b. establishing women's protection units in community organizations;

c. conducting socialization of women's rights independently;

d. conducting preventive measures if indications of violence against women are found in the community;

e. providing first aid to victims; and

f. reporting to the competent authorities if violence against women occurs in their environment.

(3) Community participation as referred to in paragraph (1) may be carried out by individuals, community social institutions, non-governmental organizations, educational institutions, religious institutions, the private sector, and/or mass media.
